  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AD22-QA-003-NO-TEST-COVERAGE" ;
  triage:title "Missing regression/smoke test for roster-backed pane nudge" ;
  triage:description "Sprint AD.22's acceptance criterion 'targeted regression or smoke coverage proves a roster-backed pane id is sufficient for local tmux nudge with no .atm.toml pane lookup' is unmet. req-qa found no new test was added this sprint that validates this criterion. AD.21 contained test_roster_match_skips_toml_fallback_lookup which explicitly tested roster-only path, but this was removed in AD.22 without a replacement. The only related test in AD.22 (test_roster_match_nudges_without_warning, test_roster_match_uses_roster_pane) predates the acceptance criterion change and does not assert absence of .atm.toml involvement." ;
